WEBVTT

00:03:58.292 --> 00:04:01.559
The gravity of that moment was so strong,

00:04:01.583 --> 00:04:05.059
but I knew I needed to resist
that urge to move in

00:04:05.083 --> 00:04:06.893
and to comfort her.

00:04:06.917 --> 00:04:08.434
That sounds crazy, right?

00:04:08.458 --> 00:04:10.101
Honestly, it's excruciating.

00:04:10.125 --> 00:04:13.333
In your mind and in your heart,
you just want to hug this person.

00:04:14.042 --> 00:04:15.333
But I stopped myself.

00:04:16.208 --> 00:04:18.684
Having been around trauma
for over 20 years,

00:04:18.708 --> 00:04:20.184
I will tell you

00:04:20.208 --> 00:04:23.184
not everybody is comfortable
with human touch.

00:04:23.208 --> 00:04:24.934
There are people all over the world

00:04:24.958 --> 00:04:28.018
suffering from physical
or psychological trauma

00:04:28.042 --> 00:04:29.583
you may know nothing about.